{"id":"vod_jy_111646","vodId":"111646","provider":"jy","providerName":"金鹰资源","type":2,"name":"青空AIR","name_cn":"青空AIR","date":"2005-01-01","year":"2005","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第13集總集篇","images":{"common":"https://image.jinyingimage.com/cover/ddb457c14097c52ebbfe2d269373bf24.jpg"},"summary":"这是一个跨越千年的故事。以表演人偶为生的青年国崎往人（小野大辅 配音）行走到了一个海边的小镇。四处游走的往人一直在寻找着“空中的少女”，这是往人的母亲逝世前曾一直对他说的话。原来流传着这样一个故事。有着翅膀的女孩被视为不幸的象征，终日被关在不见光的房间里，直到遇到那个命定的少年。二人就这样相爱了，但这恋情是不被允许的。于是女孩受到诅咒，陷入了轮回之中。往人在小镇里邂逅了少女神尾观铃（川上伦子 配音）。体弱多病的观铃和传说中的女孩极其相似。而他们的相遇如同千年前的那个传说，轮回的齿轮又开始了不休的运作……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-05-27 14:10:03","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"jinyingm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/bkR2R7va/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/e7393XBe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/e5y7yWYe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/axk6kVle/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/dJ686PKd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/dPNjNYAa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/bYE7EMAb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/azp6pnqd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/bo2Z2vYa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/bqxQx27a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/bqxQxZya/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集完结","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/egJpJkrd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集總集篇","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/bkR2R7Ja/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T11:56:33.988Z"}